<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58481" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοῖτος</span></b> , ὁ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽκεῖμαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>resting-place, bed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοίτοιο μεδώμεθα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					3.334
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.358
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ δ᾽ ἐπὶ κοῖτον ἐσσεύοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					14.455
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στυγερὸς δ᾽ ὑπεδέξατο κ.</span>,
			of birds, <i><span class="en">
				22.470
			</span></i>; <i>stall, fold</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				1116
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάγειν ἐπὶ κοῖτον</span>
			<i>pen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longus
				1.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sleep</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὴν νὺξ ἔλθῃ, ἕλῃσί τε κ.
					ἅπαντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.515
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοίτοιο ὥρη</span>
			<i>bed</i>-time, ib.<i><span class="en">
				510
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἠόα κ.</span>
			<i>lying abed</i> till dawn, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				574
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ὑπασπίδιον κοῖτον
			ἰαύειν</span> sleep under arms, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				740
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ποιεεσθαι</span> go to
				<i>bed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς κ. παρεῖναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
